---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | NoMore5Mins"
  description="Privacy Policy for NoMore5Mins. Learn how we handle your data, what we collect, and how we protect your privacy."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-slate-50 sm:text-5xl">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 dark-muted">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-400 dark-muted">

      <section>
        <p>
          At NoMore5Mins, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains what information
          we collect, how we use it, and what choices you have. We believe in transparency and
          keeping things simple &mdash; just like our tools.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          NoMore5Mins is designed to work without requiring any personal information from you.
          We do not ask you to create an account, provide your name, or share your email address
          to use our tools.
        </p>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Information Collected Automatically</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">
          When you visit our site, certain information is collected automatically through analytics
          and advertising services:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>Browser type and version</li>
          <li>Operating system</li>
          <li>Pages visited and time spent on each page</li>
          <li>Referring website or source</li>
          <li>General geographic location (country/region level)</li>
          <li>Device type (desktop, mobile, tablet)</li>
          <li>Screen resolution</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Information Stored Locally on Your Device</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">
          NoMore5Mins uses your browser's <strong class="text-slate-50 dark-text">localStorage</strong> to save
          your preferences and settings. This data never leaves your device and is not transmitted
          to our servers. Locally stored data includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>Theme preference (dark or light mode)</li>
          <li>Alarm settings (times, labels, sounds)</li>
          <li>Timer and Pomodoro preferences</li>
          <li>World clock timezone selections</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You can clear this data at any time by clearing your browser's site data for NoMore5Mins.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">How We Use Information</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          The limited information we collect is used to:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>Understand how visitors use our tools so we can improve them</li>
          <li>Monitor site performance and fix technical issues</li>
          <li>Display relevant advertisements to support the free service</li>
          <li>Analyze traffic trends and usage patterns in aggregate</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We do not sell your personal information. We do not build user profiles. We do not
          track you across other websites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          NoMore5Mins itself does not set cookies. However, our third-party services (described below)
          may use cookies to function properly. These cookies are governed by the privacy policies
          of those respective services.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          You can control cookie behavior through your browser settings. Blocking cookies may
          affect the display of advertisements but will not impact the functionality of our tools.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Third-Party Services</h2>

        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Google Analytics</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact with our site. Google Analytics
          collects information such as how often users visit the site, what pages they visit, and
          what other sites they used prior to coming to our site. We use this information solely
          to improve NoMore5Mins. Google Analytics collects the IP address assigned to you on the
          date you visit our site, but we do not combine this with other data to identify you personally.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You can opt out of Google Analytics by installing the
          <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Google AdSense</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We use Google AdSense to display advertisements on our site. AdSense may use cookies and
          web beacons to serve ads based on your prior visits to our site or other sites on the internet.
          Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your
          visit to NoMore5Mins and/or other sites on the internet.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
          <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">Google Ads Settings</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Data Security</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We take reasonable precautions to protect the limited information associated with our service.
          Our site is served over HTTPS to ensure data transmitted between your browser and our servers
          is encrypted. Since we do not collect personal information or maintain user accounts, the
          risk of a data breach affecting you personally is minimal.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          NoMore5Mins is a general-audience tool and does not knowingly collect personal information
          from children under the age of 13. Since we do not require account creation or collect
          personal data, children can use our time tools without providing any identifying information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the
          "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this policy
          periodically to stay informed about how we are protecting your privacy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-50 dark-text">Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@nomore5mins.com" class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">hello@nomore5mins.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
